.TH pons-man 1  "man "
.SH NAME
pons\-man \- Generate the main or a subcommand man page from the live command model
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpons man\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fICOMMAND\fR]
